<title>UK: Iran buys cargo of white sugar at $306/tonne-trade.</title>
<headline>Iran buys cargo of white sugar at $306/tonne-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran bought a cargo of white sugar for delivery in February/March at a tender earlier this week, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price reported was $306 per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>No more details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
